(   40) 
(   41) !     *RAMID*   REAL      BASE VALUE FOR CALCULATION OF RELATIVE 
(   42) !                         HUMIDITY THRESHOLD FOR ONSET OF STRATIFORM
(   43) !                         CONDENSATION (TIEDTKE, 1993, EQUATION 24)
(   44) !     *RCLDIFF* REAL      DIFFUSION-COEFFICIENT FOR EVAPORATION BY
(   45) !                         TURBULENT MIXING (IBID., EQU. 30)
(   46) !     *RCLDIFF_CONVI*REAL ENHANCEMENT FACTOR OF  RCLDIFF FOR CONVECTION
(   47) !     *RCLCRIT* REAL      BASE VALUE OF CRITICAL CLOUD WATER CONTENT 
(   48) !                         FOR CONVERSION TO RAIN (SUNDQUIST, 1988)
(   49) !     *RCLCRIT_SEA* REAL  BASE VALUE OF CRITICAL CLOUD WATER CONTENT FOR SEA
(   50) !     *RCLCRIT_LAND* REAL BASE VALUE OF CRITICAL CLOUD WATER CONTENT FOR LAND






