(   51) !     *RKCONV*  REAL      BASE VALUE FOR CONVERSION COEFFICIENT (IBID.)
(   52) !     *RPRC1*   REAL      COALESCENCE CONSTANT (IBID.)
(   53) !     *RPRC2*   REAL      BERGERON-FINDEISEN CONSTANT (IBID.)
(   54) !     *RCLDMAX* REAL      MAXIMUM CLOUD WATER CONTENT
(   55) !     *RPECONS* REAL      EVAPORATION CONSTANT AFTER KESSLER 
(   56) !                         (TIEDTKE, 1993, EQU.35)
(   57) !     *RPRECRHMAX* REAL   MAX THRESHOLD RH FOR EVAPORATION FOR ZERO COVER
(   58) !     *RTAUMEL* REAL      RELAXATION TIME FOR MELTING OF SNOW
