(   67) !     *RCOVPMIN*  REAL    MINIMUM PRECIPITATION COVERAGE REQUIRED FOR THE NEW PROGNOSTIC PRECIP
(   68) !     *RCLDTOPP*  REAL    TOP PRESSURE FOR CLOUD CALCULATION
(   69) !     *NCLDTOP*   INTEGER TOP LEVEL FOR CLOUD CALCULATION
